          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ mũsumbĩ atũmana mũthembi Aimeleki, mwana wa Aituvu, etwe, na nyũmba yonthe ya ĩthe, athembi ala maĩ Novu: namo mooka onthe kwa mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Saulo amwĩa, Ĩw’a yu, we mwana wa Aituvu. Nake asũngĩa, Ninyioo, mwĩaĩi wakwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Saulo amũkũlya, Nĩkĩ mũnzamĩĩte, we na mwana wa Yese, ũndũ wamũnengie imũtũ, o na ũvyũ, na wakũlilye Ngai nũndũ wake, nĩ kana ambũkĩlĩle, na kũmboveesya, o tondũ ũilyĩ ũmũnthĩ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
