          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũmwe wa ana ma Aimeleki, mwana wa Aituvu, wetawa Aviathali, avuthũka, na akĩa aatĩĩe Ndaviti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Aviathali atavya Ndaviti kana Saulo nũmoaĩte athembi ma Yeova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ndaviti amwĩa Aviathali, Nĩnamanyie mũthenya ũsu, yĩla Ndoeki Mũetomu waĩ vau, kana vate ndĩi akamũtavya Saulo: ninyie kĩtumi kya andũ onthe ma nyũmba ya au kũkw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
